  "packageHash": "MYvB9W9Qa9UJldMZOo3VUPB/A4wL+OGaYC6S4XLuXGeCsKjiR/0TvYmpa/O9DyuJNPidSQ1oTpNPJkpNTL3hPQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 42959,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Frognar/dotValid",
  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced `Validated<T>` type for explicit representation of validation results (success or failure with errors).\n          - Added `ValidationError` record struct for standardized error reporting (PropertyName, Error).\n          - Provided `Validation` static class with `Succeed` and `Failed` helper methods for easy `Validated<T>` instance creation.\n          - Implemented `ValidatedApplicative` extension methods, enabling applicative programming for `Validated<T>`.\n          - `Apply` extension methods facilitate combining multiple validated values and aggregating all validation errors.",
